      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Role Onboarding v2 · seven educator roles (Proposed)",
      "seed": 987155167,
      "text": "Role Onboarding v2 · seven educator roles (Proposed)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2066745340,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "width": 1600,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0
    },
    {
      "autoResize": false,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "height": 75.0,
      "id": "mwdkjcuoypjvf2",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "Each row is one role, left to right: the invite, accepting it, the welcome on the place the role is about, and the role's first task. Arrows follow the buttons. One sample district; each person brings in the next, from Endless Access down to the Facilitator. Roles follow the 12 Nov 2026 check-in with Joana (no Org Educator, no Cohort Manager; not built). Hover the numbered markers in each screen for the design notes.",
      "seed": 1250860009,
      "text": "Each row is one role, left to right: the invite, accepting it, the welcome on the place the role is about, and the role's first task. Arrows follow the buttons. One sample district; each\nperson brings in the next, from Endless Access down to the Facilitator. Roles follow the 12 Nov 2026 check-in with Joana (no Org Educator, no Cohort Manager; not built). Hover the numbered\nmarkers in each screen for the design notes.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
